OL,3,GNEWSACrews leave scrap fire that
OL,4,Asparked huge smoke plume
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire at a recycling centre
OL,7,Finvolving scrap metal and electrical
OL,8,Fitems has been put out.
OL,10,FCrews in 10 fire engines were called to
OL,11,Fthe site at Candys Lane in Corfe
OL,12,FMullen, east Dorset, shortly after
OL,13,F02:30 BST on Tuesday. It had sent a
OL,14,Flarge plume of smoke visible in the
OL,15,Farea through much of the day.
OL,17,FResidents were asked to keep doors and
OL,18,Fwindows shut as smoke drifted across
OL,19,Fthe area, and drivers on the nearby A31
OL,20,Fwere warned that smoke could affect
OL,21,Fvisibility.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
