OL,3,GNEWSACrews leave scrap fire that
OL,4,Asparked huge smoke plume
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,7,FService said crews left the scene at
OL,8,Fabout 21:00. It added that a follow-up
OL,9,Finspection on Wednesday morning found
OL,10,F"no concerns" and a fire investigation
OL,11,Fwas set to be carried out.
